1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"library--the-multipass-method","kind":"library-article","route":"/roadmap/library/the-multipass-method","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/library/the-multipass-method","sourceHash":"153d298fd35b9fd23449d5dca7721cce71a3344112ef4b6a285820bcf4b42a73","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:11:09.705Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"The Multipass Method","zh":"多遍学习法"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"This is a fancy name for using the same thing several times for immersion practice, potentially with very different approaches. For example:","zh":"这是一个听起来很高级的名称，指的是多次使用同一份内容进行沉浸练习，而且每次采用的方法可能截然不同。例如："}},{"id":"segment-0002","type":"list","ordered":true,"items":[{"en":"First you slowly read through a movie, pausing on the subtitles and looking up unknown words","zh":"首先，慢慢地看完一部电影，遇到字幕时暂停，并查找不认识的词"},{"en":"Then you watch the movie again, this time without pausing","zh":"然后再看一遍电影，这次不要暂停"},{"en":"After that, you listen to the audiobook it was adapted from while reading along with the text","zh":"之后，一边阅读原著文本，一边听这部电影改编自的那本书的有声版本"},{"en":"And finally, you listen to the whole book again, while doing chores and other things around the house","zh":"最后，在做家务和处理其他家中事务时，再把整本有声书听一遍"}]},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"That's a very specific version of The Multipass Method, for you it will almost certainly look different. But reusing the same thing several times, in many different ways, allows you to pick up more and more from the content each time.","zh":"这是多遍学习法的一种非常具体的实践方式，而你的做法几乎肯定会有所不同。不过，以多种不同方式反复使用同一份内容，能让你每次都从中学到更多。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"The simplest version of this would be to watch something several times, but many people find this too boring without the added interest of a new approach.","zh":"最简单的做法是把同一份内容看上几遍，但如果没有新方法带来的额外趣味，许多人会觉得这样太无聊。"}}],"cards":[]}}]
